{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26678","headline":"书怀寄友人 · 姚合","name":"书怀寄友人","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"精心奉北宗，微宦在南宫。\n举世劳爲适，开门事不穷。\n年来复几日，蝉去又鸣鸿。\n衰疾谁人问，闲情与酒通。\n四邻寒稍静，九陌夜方空。\n知老何山是，思归愚谷中。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"姚合","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_26678.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26678","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}